        "username": "McBehrer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-18T16:27:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Nope. People’s Hammer, Fire Blast, and Go Bots! Are the only unlimited innates. It is balanced because Beacon has other things Ra does not, like mobility, several other attacks, and the ability to disregard line of sight.</p>",
